save_UNCERTAINTY
    _definition.id               UNCERTAINTY
    _definition.scope            Category
    _definition.class            Set
    _definition.update           2026-03-09
    _description.text
;
    Any data name may have an associated uncertainty by appending
    '_uncertainty' to the original data name. The uncertainty value
    is a floating point number representing the standard uncertainty
    of the associated measurement.
;
save_
